OL,3,GNEWSAManager believed gas test was
OL,4,Adone, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA safety officer who was on call when a
OL,7,Fgas explosion occurred at Haut du Mont
OL,8,Fflats on 10 December 2022 believed a
OL,9,Ftest on a gas supply had taken place
OL,10,Fwhen it had not, a court has heard.
OL,12,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,13,Fand Lee Ward deny 10 counts of gross
OL,14,Fnegligence manslaughter and Island
OL,15,FEnergy has also pleaded not guilty in a
OL,16,Fcombined health and safety case.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
