OL,3,GNEWSAManager believed gas test was
OL,4,Adone, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Johnstone, former Island Energy
OL,7,Fsafety and compliance officer, told
OL,8,FJersey's Royal Court a pressure test
OL,9,Fhad to be done to ensure "the
OL,10,Finstallation is gas tight" before gas
OL,11,Fcould be reintroduced.
OL,13,FHe said if he had known the test had
OL,14,Fnot been carried out he would have
OL,15,Fasked for work on the gas main to stop.
